RocketHideout_B4F_Text_GiovanniIntro::
    .string "VESPER: So you are the brat who\n"
    .string "keeps wrecking my plans.\p"
    .string "This old ROCKET base suits TEAM\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS. Dark, deep, forgotten.\p"
    .string "Perfect for hiding what we take\n"
    .string "from this town. Now, scram!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
    .string "Impossible...!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_GiovanniPostBattle::
    .string "VESPER: Hmph. You beat me...\n"
    .string "in a fight. Fights are for fools.\p"
    .string "I have the QUARTZ in my pocket.\p"
    .string "Let us settle it like adults: at my\n"
    .string "table in the GAME CORNER, upstairs.\p"
    .string "Win, and you keep it. Lose, and it\n"
    .string "is mine. Come, if you dare!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt2Intro::
    .string "I know you!\n"
    .string "You ruined our plans at MT. MOON!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt2Defeat::
    .string "Burned again!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle::
    .string "Do you have something against TEAM\n"
    .string "ONYBRIS?$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt3Intro::
    .string "How can you not see the beauty of\n"
    .string "our evil?$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt3Defeat::
    .string "Ayaya!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt3PostBattle::
    .string "BOSS!\n"
    .string "I'm sorry I failed you!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt1Intro::
    .string "The elevator doesn't work?\n"
    .string "Who has the LIFT KEY?$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt1Defeat::
    .string "No!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle::
    .string "Oh, no!\n"
    .string "I dropped the LIFT KEY!$"


RocketHideout_B4F_Text_FoundRocketLedger::
    .string "{PLAYER} found an old ROCKET ledger.\p"
    .string "Inside was a battered case: the\n"
    .string "POKé FLUTE, stolen from MR. FUJI!$"

RocketHideout_B4F_Text_ReceivedPokeFlute::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the POKé FLUTE.\p"
    .string "It wakes sleeping POKéMON.$"
